    "system": {
        "id": "resolute-stand",
        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p><em>You project resolve, and even powerful groups of opponents find it hard to focus their attention elsewhere.</em></p><p>When you use your @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.yFWkmaGMs359A7DB]{Valiant Intervention}, you can spend focus up to your ranks in <strong>Leadership</strong> to target that many additional characters.</p><p>Additionally, after you affect a target with Valiant Intervention, they can’t make @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.QpFIxaoCBezzt6yw]{Reactive Strikes} against your allies until the end of that target’s next turn.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.yFWkmaGMs359A7DB]{Valiant Intervention} prevents @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.QpFIxaoCBezzt6yw]{Reactive Strikes}. Spend focus up to your ranks in <strong>Leadership</strong> to add that many targets for Valiant Intervention.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p>When you use your @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.yFWkmaGMs359A7DB]{Valiant Intervention}, you can spend focus up to your ranks in <strong>Leadership</strong> to target that many additional characters.</p><p>Additionally, after you affect a target with Valiant Intervention, they can’t make @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.QpFIxaoCBezzt6yw]{Reactive Strikes} against your allies until the end of that target’s next turn.</p>"
        },
